      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1 to we should only ever have one, but yea I thought about this because that alone would be a bit fragile.\n\nHowever, I don\u0027t think it\u0027s a concern since we don\u0027t pass these libraries as `-l` or `-L` flags during the link step, we only pass the full path to the `.a` file. So there shouldn\u0027t be a problem in the case above AFAIUI.\n\nSee for example\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/cc/library.go;l\u003d1166-1172\n\nWhich takes the output and passes the path directly to the linker at\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/cc/builder.go;l\u003d871-881",
